  "description": "Mongoose was born from BMX racing with products that push the limits of what a rider can do on the track. Our latest line of BMX-style race bikes, the Title series, have been designed using that same race pedigree. Designed for beginner-level riders, the Mongoose Title Junior gives you a trophy-worthy bike at an amazingly affordable price!\nLightweight Tectonic T1 aluminum frame, integrated headset and internal cable routing. 18.50” top tube length and frame weight of 2.76 lbs.\nDrivetrain features 150mm 3-piece tubular chromoly cranks with a 40T chainring and euro cartridge bottom bracket.\nArisun XLR8 20” tires mounted on Xposure® aluminum double wall rims with aluminum ball bearing front hub and 16T cog freewheel rear hub.\nHi-Ten steel handlebar and fork, 30mm stem, sealed bearing headset, and alloy V-brake and brake levers. Suggested rider height is 4’6” - 5’1”.",
